# Turkish 3rd-person possessive suffix -(s)I marks the season in the
# year-first construction ("2020 sonbaharı" == "2020's autumn"). "sonbahar"
# ends in a consonant with a back unrounded last vowel (a), giving -ı:
# sonbaharı. "güz" ends in a consonant with a front rounded last vowel (ü),
# giving -ü: güzü. TDK, İyelik ekleri: https://sozluk.gov.tr
sonbahar
sonbaharı
güz
güzü
